ask t4_s75_y30: rate_pct[e1946, s75, y30, w, indexed] for w in wr

ask t5_e1926_fixed_y20: rate_pct[e1926, m603010, y20, w, fixed] for w in wr

ask t5_e1926_fixed_y25: rate_pct[e1926, m603010, y25, w, fixed] for w in wr

