ask t6_text: round(100 * t6_mean[e1946, y20, indexed], 0.1, stat_round), round(100 * t6_median[e1946, y20, indexed], 0.1, stat_round), round(100 * t6_min[e1946, y20, indexed], 0.1, stat_round)

ask t6a_max: round(100 * t6_max[r, h, fixed], 0.1, stat_round) for r in era, h in hz

ask t6a_mean: round(100 * t6_mean[r, h, fixed], 0.1, stat_round) for r in era, h in hz

ask t6a_median: round(100 * t6_median[r, h, fixed], 0.1, stat_round) for r in era, h in hz

